    title: "X suspends campaign account of Palestinian American running for US Senate",
    summary: "X suspends campaign account of Palestinian American running for US Senate A Palestinian American who launched his bid for a Senate seat to represent Pennsylvania in the 2028 election has had his campaign account suspended by the social media platform X. The account, @moorforpa, belongs to Gaza-born, Philadelphia-raised Ahmed Moor, who said this week he wants to topple hardline pro- Israel Senator John Fetterman when he's up for re-election in two years. Fetterman has not announced whether he plans to run again. \"FRIENDS! It's official! We're a threat,\" Moor wrote on his personal X account on Wednesday. \"They've suspended the campaign account. Help us maintain the momentum by retweeting and please consider donating.\" g for US Senate Ahmed Moor, who is running for a Pennsylvania seat in the US Senate in 2028, is pictured in a undated photo from his campaign website (MoorForSenate.com)",
    preview: "X suspends campaign account of Palestinian American running for US Senate A Palestinian American who launched his bid for a Senate seat to represent Pennsylvania in the 2028 election has had his campaign account suspended by the social media platform X. The account, @moorforpa, belongs to Gaza-born, Philadelphia-raised Ahmed Moor, who said this week he wants to topple hardline pro- Israel Senator John Fetterman when he's up for re-election in two years. Fetterman has not announced whether he plans to run again. \"FRIENDS! It's official!",
